Description: Native Rust background removal with CUDA acceleration
 Remove image backgrounds locally using Bria RMBG-3.0. This build uses
 NVIDIA CUDA 12.1 and requires a compatible host driver and CUDA runtime.
 The model weights download automatically on first use.
